<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" name="viewport" />
    <title>VotoTrack - Monitoramento Legislativo Transparente</title>

    <!-- Bootstrap 5 CSS -->
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.2/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">

    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Public+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:wght,FILL@100..700,0..1&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />

    <style>
        :root {
            /* Palette de Cores Customizada */
            --primary: #041627;
            --primary-container: #1a2b3c;
            --on-primary: #ffffff;
            --secondary: #006d37;
            --secondary-container: #6bfe9c;
            --on-secondary-container: #00743a;
            --background: #f8f9ff;
            --on-surface: #0b1c30;
            --on-surface-variant: #44474c;
            --outline-variant: #c4c6cd;
            --surface-container-low: #eff4ff;
            --surface-container-high: #dce9ff;
            --inverse-primary: #b7c8de;
            --error: #ba1a1a;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--background);
            color: var(--on-surface);
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        h1, h2, h3, .font-h {
            font-family: 'Public Sans', sans-serif;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .material-symbols-outlined {
            font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 0, 'wght' 400, 'GRAD' 0, 'opsz' 24;
            vertical-align: middle;
        }

        /* Custom Classes para manter o estilo */
        .btn-primary-custom {
            background-color: var(--primary);
            color: var(--on-primary);
            border: none;
            padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
            border-radius: 0.5rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            transition: all 0.2s;
        }

            .btn-primary-custom:hover {
                background-color: var(--primary-container);
                transform: translateY(-1px);
            }

        .nav-link-custom {
            color: var(--on-surface-variant);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 0.875rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            transition: color 0.2s;
        }

            .nav-link-custom:hover {
                color: var(--primary);
            }

        .nav-active {
            color: var(--primary);
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--primary);
        }

        .hero-section {
            padding: 80px 0;
            background-color: white;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--outline-variant);
        }

        .card-custom {
            background: white;
            border: 1px solid var(--outline-variant);
            border-radius: 1rem;
            padding: 2.5rem;
            transition: box-shadow 0.3s;
        }

            .card-custom:hover {
                box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
            }

        .bento-card {
            border-radius: 1rem;
            padding: 2rem;
            height: 400px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: space-between;
            border: 1px solid var(--outline-variant);
        }

        .label-caps {
            font-size: 12px;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="bg-white sticky-top border-bottom">
        <nav class="container-xxl d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between" style="height: 64px;">
            <div class="fs-4 fw-black text-primary" style="font-family: 'Public Sans'; letter-spacing: -1px;">VotoTrack</div>

            <div class="d-none d-md-flex gap-4">
                <a class="nav-link-custom nav-active pb-1" href="#">Explorar</a>
                <a class="nav-link-custom" href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="window.location.href='/Dashboard/Publico'" style="cursor: pointer; text-decoration: none;">Dashboard</a>
                <a class="nav-link-custom" href="/Explorar/FAQ">API</a>
            </div>

            <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-3">
                <button class="btn-primary-custom" onclick="window.location.href='/Auth/Index'">Entrar</button>
            </div>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
        <!-- Hero Section -->
        <section class="hero-section">
            <div class="container-xxl">
                <div class="row align-items-center g-5">
                    <div class="col-lg-6">
                        <span class="badge rounded-pill mb-3 py-2 px-3" style="background-color: var(--surface-container-high); color: var(--on-secondary-container);">TRANSPARÊNCIA RADICAL</span>
                        <h1 class="display-4 mb-4 text-primary">Acompanhe como seu deputado vota</h1>
                        <p class="lead text-muted mb-5">Monitore em tempo real as decisões do Legislativo. Dados oficiais extraídos diretamente da Câmara e do Senado para o seu bolso.</p>
                        <div class="d-flex flex-column flex-sm-row gap-3">
                            <button class="btn btn-primary btn-lg rounded-3 px-4 py-3 d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center gap-2"
                                    style="background-color: var(--primary);"
                                    onclick="window.location.href='/Auth/Index'">
                                Começar a monitorar
                                <span class="material-symbols-outlined">arrow_forward</span>
                            </button>
                            <button class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-lg rounded-3 px-4 py-3"
                                    onclick="window.location.href='/Dashboard/Publico'">
                                Ver Dashboard Público
                            </button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-lg-6 position-relative">
                        <div class="position-absolute translate-middle rounded-circle blur" style="width: 250px; height: 250px; background: rgba(183,200,222,0.3); z-index: -1; top: 20%; left: 20%; filter: blur(60px);"></div>
                        <div class="bg-white p-2 rounded-4 shadow-lg border" style="transform: rotate(2deg);">
                            <img alt="Dashboard" class="img-fluid rounded-3" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuA4jG6gC6P3tvzXaFU1vg1ThsouOWF3EQn2Lp9Jek_EI4Vh7_eC2aZCIM4aKYd0i1-I5vdtsN6tjaEC3R2iD-TeyIo-5HKGeEjmEU3HflKzeUxd_6QkMOv0gW-4hCdvUBxWwPhtcJAUyR-53x7u8-tMDSzHAS7XhW-Buo3VDEoqjFrzSHrpc8s0riYdhpViT6ziSMO-YzTkvw8bRVuvv2qOmckOdCwHOBD13sRI05Pe2haP-01ju5ngVnWkA-nrEWeSnA18wl9MhULA" style="filter: grayscale(0.2) contrast(1.1);">
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Data Sources -->
        <section class="py-5" style="background-color: #ffffff;">
            <div class="container-xxl py-5">
                <div class="text-center mb-5">
                    <h2 class="display-6 text-primary mb-3">Dados Abertos, Decisões Reais</h2>
                    <p class="text-muted mx-auto" style="max-width: 600px;">Conectamos você diretamente às fontes oficiais do Governo Federal, garantindo informações imparciais.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="row g-4">
                    <div class="col-md-6">
                        <div class="card-custom">
                            <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center bg-light rounded mb-4" style="width: 48px; height: 48px;">
                                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary fs-2">account_balance</span>
                            </div>
                            <h3 class="h4 text-primary">Câmara dos Deputados</h3>
                            <p class="text-muted">Integração total com a API de Dados Abertos da Câmara. Acesse perfis, gastos de gabinete e proposições.</p>
                            <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 text-success fw-bold label-caps">
                                <span class="material-symbols-outlined fs-6">check_circle</span> CONEXÃO ATIVA
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-6">
                        <div class="card-custom">
                            <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center bg-light rounded mb-4" style="width: 48px; height: 48px;">
                                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary fs-2">assured_workload</span>
                            </div>
                            <h3 class="h4 text-primary">Senado Federal</h3>
                            <p class="text-muted">Acompanhamento das comissões e plenário do Senado. Transparência total sobre a tramitação de projetos.</p>
                            <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 text-success fw-bold label-caps">
                                <span class="material-symbols-outlined fs-6">check_circle</span> CONEXÃO ATIVA
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- How it works -->
        <section class="py-5">
            <div class="container-xxl py-5">
                <h2 class="display-6 text-primary text-center mb-5">Como o VotoTrack funciona</h2>
                <div class="row g-4">
                    <div class="col-md-4">
                        <div class="bento-card" style="background-color: var(--surface-container-low);">
                            <div>
                                <div class="display-4 fw-black text-primary opacity-25">01</div>
                                <h3 class="h4 text-primary">Escolha quem seguir</h3>
                                <p class="text-muted">Favorite os deputados e senadores que você deseja monitorar de perto.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="bg-white p-3 rounded-3 shadow-sm d-flex align-items-center gap-3">
                                <div class="rounded-circle bg-light" style="width: 40px; height: 40px;"></div>
                                <div class="flex-grow-1"><div class="bg-light w-75 mb-1" style="height: 8px;"></div><div class="bg-light w-50" style="height: 8px;"></div></div>
                                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary">bookmarks</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-4">
                        <div class="bento-card" style="background-color: var(--primary); color: white;">
                            <div>
                                <div class="display-4 fw-black text-white opacity-25">02</div>
                                <h3 class="h4">Rastreie Votações</h3>
                                <p style="color: var(--inverse-primary);">Receba o histórico de como seu parlamentar votou em temas cruciais.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="d-flex flex-column gap-2">
                                <div class="p-2 rounded bg-success text-white fw-bold" style="font-size: 10px;">SIM: 74%</div>
                                <div class="p-2 rounded bg-danger text-white fw-bold" style="font-size: 10px;">NÃO: 26%</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-4">
                        <div class="bento-card" style="background-color: var(--surface-container-low);">
                            <div>
                                <div class="display-4 fw-black text-primary opacity-25">03</div>
                                <h3 class="h4 text-primary">Alertas em Tempo Real</h3>
                                <p class="text-muted">Não perca nenhuma movimentação. Ative notificações para novos projetos.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="bg-white p-3 rounded-3 shadow-sm d-flex align-items-center gap-3">
                                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-danger">notifications_active</span>
                                <div class="small fw-bold">Nova votação iniciada em Brasília</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- CTA -->
        <section class="py-5">
            <div class="container-xxl py-5 text-center">
                <div class="p-5 rounded-5 text-white position-relative overflow-hidden" style="background-color: var(--primary);">
                    <div class="position-absolute top-0 end-0 rounded-circle" style="width: 300px; height: 300px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); margin-right: -100px; margin-top: -100px;"></div>
                    <h2 class="display-5 mb-4">Pronto para exercer sua cidadania?</h2>
                    <p class="mb-5 mx-auto" style="max-width: 500px; color: var(--inverse-primary);">Junte-se a mais de 50.000 brasileiros que monitoram o poder de perto.</p>
                    <div class="d-flex flex-column flex-sm-row justify-content-center gap-3">
                        <button class="btn btn-lg px-5 py-3 fw-bold" style="background-color: var(--secondary-container); color: var(--on-secondary-container);" onclick="window.location.href='/Auth/Index'">Criar Conta Gratuita</button>
                        <button class="btn btn-outline-light btn-lg px-5 py-3 fw-bold" onclick="window.location.href='/Explorar/FAQ'">Ver FAQ</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="bg-white border-top py-5">
        <div class="container-xxl">
            <div class="row g-4 justify-content-between mb-5">
                <div class="col-lg-3">
                    <div class="fw-bold fs-5 text-primary mb-3">VotoTrack</div>
                    <p class="small text-muted">Dados abertos para uma democracia transparente. Monitorando o futuro através dos dados do presente.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="col-lg-4 text-lg-end">
                    <div class="label-caps text-primary mb-3">Recursos</div>
                    <ul class="list-unstyled small d-flex flex-column gap-2">
                        <li><a href="/Explorar/FAQ" class="text-muted text-decoration-none">FAQ & API Docs</a></li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="border-top pt-4">
                <span class="label-caps text-muted" style="font-size: 10px;">Feito com ética e transparência tecnológica.</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </footer>

    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.2/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
</body>
</html>